sequenceDiagram
    actor Driver
    participant App as App (phone)
    participant Server
    participant Broker as MQTT Broker
    participant Flap as Flap (ESP32)

    Note over App,Server: App ↔ Server = HTTP
    Note over Server,Flap: Server ↔ Flap = MQTT

    rect rgb(230,245,255)
    Note over Driver,Flap: OPEN — triggered by the app button
    Driver->>App: tap "open"
    App->>Server: HTTP POST /open
    Server->>Broker: publish flap/01/command {drop}
    Broker->>Flap: {drop}
    Flap-->>Broker: flap/01/status {flapState:down}
    Broker-->>Server: {flapState:down}
    end

    rect rgb(235,255,235)
    Note over Driver,Flap: CAR ENTERS — sensor reports, server logs "in"
    Driver->>Flap: drives in
    Flap-->>Broker: flap/01/status {presence:occupied}
    Broker-->>Server: {presence:occupied}
    Note over Server: log IN event (this booking)
    end

    rect rgb(255,240,235)
    Note over Driver,Flap: CAR LEAVES — this is "close", triggered by the sensor
    Driver->>Flap: drives off
    Flap-->>Broker: flap/01/status {presence:free}
    Broker-->>Server: {presence:free}
    Note over Server: log OUT event
    Server->>Broker: publish flap/01/command {raise}
    Broker->>Flap: {raise}
    Flap-->>Broker: flap/01/status {flapState:up}
    end

    Note over Driver,Flap: booking still ACTIVE — driver may open + re-enter<br/>until endTime passes (then booking auto-ends)
